---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Legal & Support"
  description="LittlePickle policies, account controls, and support resources in one place."
>
  <section>
    <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>
      Learn what LittlePickle collects, why it is needed, how it is shared, and how to exercise your
      privacy choices.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/privacy/">Read the Privacy Policy</a></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Support</h2>
    <p>Get help with the app, leagues, QR codes, profiles, accessibility, or account requests.</p>
    <p><a href="/support/">Visit Support</a></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Account Deletion</h2>
    <p>Review the in-app deletion steps, 30-day recovery period, and what is removed or anonymized.</p>
    <p><a href="/account-deletion/">View Account Deletion instructions</a></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Terms of Use</h2>
    <p>Review the terms that apply when using the LittlePickle app, website, and related services.</p>
    <p><a href="/terms/">Read the Terms of Use</a></p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
